  "question": {
    "text": "A message signal of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math> is used to modulate a carrier signal of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MHz</mi></math>. The bandwidth for amplitude modulation is:",
