  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;</p><p>Message frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math>&nbsp;and carrier wave frequency<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MHz</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>KHz</mi></math></p><p>The resultant signal will have bandwidth of frequency given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">c</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">m</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math>.</p><p>Thus, bandwidth for amplitude modulation is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kHz</mi></math>.</p>",
